<section>
    <h3>Four modes, one default</h3>
    <svg class="anim" viewBox="0 0 960 370" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width: 100%; max-height: 470px;" role="img" aria-label="Animation of the four modes: replay reads the file, missing records what is missing, record makes every request again, passthrough goes to the network without a file">
